-526e-4ff6-aa09-ea7faec2ca3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=aabfdbd50904cd538be0ae34f0619676, https://si.imgix.net/fff61601/uploads/origins/bf5d844e-526e-4ff6-aa09-ea7faec2ca3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6bbb5388e92aa73171649fc98cd46fe4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fff61601/uploads/origins/bf5d844e-526e-4ff6-aa09-ea7faec2ca3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=04ae14ad8d4c14d93312705009b002cf 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I love your art, and I especially love the fact you draw Lancer from fate/stay night, he's one of my favorite Type-Moon characters, and he works so well in your art style and fits so well in it. Back to my request, I'd love to see you bring my OC to life in your art style, and for how it'd look, I unfortunately don't have much a clue on what'd I want. So, I'd like to give you creative freedom in however you'd like to style it and pose my character.\n\nSpeaking of my Character, he's a cosmic based being and a book worm of the greatest degree. He's whimsical, kind, knowing, and pretty blunt and holds nothing back. He's pretty calm and very thoughtful in what he does and how it can affect everything around him.\n\nSo do with him what you want\n(And if you add Lancer to the mix I would have zero remakes and consider that a bonus, so do with that info what you will.)\n\nAnyways, thank you for your work and I can't wait to see how it turns out!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1QwM1ZkousD_1xuQ4IZeSC6VVIUiCBext", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@tu_na_MOOOON/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3140758, "client_id": 2940661, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/867fb743/uploads/origins/29e71105-3cd6-4b24-8cf2-13a3809f7d0c